{"name": "Runa Illustra", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thrown into a mysterious world bound within the pages of an ancient book, you must find your way back home. Master your spellbook to draw and cast your spells. Use them to manipulate your surroundings and solve challenging puzzles in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854360/extras/e656fc08cffb8471fd4692a8e318bee9.poster.avif?t=1755187412\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854360/extras/e656fc08cffb8471fd4692a8e318bee9.webm?t=1755187412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854360/extras/e656fc08cffb8471fd4692a8e318bee9.mp4?t=1755187412\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Draw your Spells!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore this practical glyph-based magic system. Sketch spells onto the pages of your spellbook, and cast them whenever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854360/extras/217fa05c710e6822ff1a0c157e110ef3.poster.avif?t=1755187412\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854360/extras/217fa05c710e6822ff1a0c157e110ef3.webm?t=1755187412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854360/extras/217fa05c710e6822ff1a0c157e110ef3.mp4?t=1755187412\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crystals hold the key to uncovering this world\u2019s secrets. Use your spells to influence your surroundings, think outside the box and find your own way forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854360/extras/b2ae0966bc58a76913356af69fdf1afa.poster.avif?t=1755187412\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854360/extras/b2ae0966bc58a76913356af69fdf1afa.webm?t=1755187412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854360/extras/b2ae0966bc58a76913356af69fdf1afa.mp4?t=1755187412\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Colour-blind Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colours are an important part of the puzzle-solving experience, and a dedicated colour-blind support ensures every player can experience the game to its fullest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854360/extras/896e3edb1c0e6aa661cbbe3060f14f4d.poster.avif?t=1755187412\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854360/extras/896e3edb1c0e6aa661cbbe3060f14f4d.webm?t=1755187412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854360/extras/896e3edb1c0e6aa661cbbe3060f14f4d.mp4?t=1755187412\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "The pen is your magic wand! Draw runes to cast various spells and solve intricate puzzles in this first-person puzzle adventure, set in a world trapped within a magical book.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854360/8a7ffcc6848a2548e781c6f5f87755ffc70bfdb0/header.jpg?t=1755187412", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Magic", "Puzzle", "Fantasy", "Adventure", "Relaxing", "Colorful"], "developers": "Marco Ronzulli", "publishers": "Marco Ronzulli", "release_date": "Jul 17, 2025", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "2854360", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "28 March 2025 - Demo\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/3618710/Runa_Illustra_Demo/?curator_clanid=44917508", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/nNqnS3zJb5E", "first_seen": 1743120000.0, "review_rank": 1753}